IMPORT prelude

-- Workforce Inspectorate Victoria Act 2020 (Vic) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- It uses only the built-in date functions (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_FROM_SERIAL), not the daydate library and
-- no YMD, in the shape of the Public Interest Disclosures Act 2012 encoding's date module. The days that matter are the
-- commencements in the endnotes: the Act came into operation on 1 July 2021 (s 2(2)); ss 4 to 34 and 40 of the Wage
-- Theft Amendment Act 2025 (No. 35/2025), which repealed Parts 2 and 4 and renamed the Act, commenced on 12 December
-- 2025; ss 35 to 39 of that Act (public construction, the new s 71) and s 30 of the Labour Hire Legislation Amendment
-- (Licensing) Act 2025 (No. 57/2025, which inserted s 69A) commenced on 17 December 2025. The one period is the time the
-- Inspectorate specifies under s 71(2), counted in plain days.
--
-- UNOFFICIAL VERSION: quotations from a plain-text conversion by Legalese Commons of the Word file of the Workforce
-- Inspectorate Victoria Act 2020, Version No. 005 (17 December 2025), not the authorised version. (c) State of Victoria;
